  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">National Anti-Corruption Strategy in GB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The project supports the implementation of the National Anti-Corruption Strategy (NACS) through various activities, aiming at establishing an effective regulatory and institutional framework to prevent, investigate, and combat anti-corruption in line with the United Nations Convention Against Corruption (UNCAC) and its recommendations. It builds on ongoing UNDP, UNODC and PBF initiatives, targeting systemic corruption challenges through strengthened capacity of oversight and audit institutions,</narrative>
  </description>
